cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this formalization, please cite it as below."
title: "Dynamic-Dimensional-Reduction: a Lean 4 formalization of Dynamic dimensional reduction in the Abelian sandpile"
abstract: >-
  A Lean 4 / mathlib formalization of the paper "Dynamic dimensional
  reduction in the Abelian sandpile" (Bou-Rabee).  Every theorem, lemma,
  proposition and corollary of the paper is registered as a frozen statement,
  20 in all, and all 20 are proved, with no sorry, no custom axiom and no
  cited result taken as a hypothesis.  They include the main theorem
  (dimensional reduction and self-similarity of the parallel toppling
  odometer), its corollary for the sandpile and the regularity proposition
  proved with them by one joint induction over dimension, side length and
  time.
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: Bou-Rabee
    given-names: Ahmed
keywords:
  - Lean
  - mathlib
  - formal verification
  - Abelian sandpile
  - parallel toppling
  - dimensional reduction
license: Apache-2.0
